# MO-007: Serial dilution: absorbance follows concentration, not total copper
# Design only: predictions below are not measured observations.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 H2SO4 0.001mol
add v1 CuSO4 0.001mol
measure v1 uvvis
measure v1 eyes
inspect v1
dilute v1 100mL
measure v1 uvvis
inspect v1
dilute v1 200mL
measure v1 uvvis
measure v1 eyes
inspect
